{"symbol":"MUV2.DE","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-12T22:43:37Z","info":{"address1":"Königinstrasse 107","city":"Munich","zip":"80802","country":"Germany","phone":"49 89 38 91 0","fax":"49 89 39 90 56","website":"https://www.munichre.com","industry":"Insurance - Reinsurance","industryKey":"insurance-reinsurance","industryDisp":"Insurance - Reinsurance","sector":"Financial Services","sectorKey":"financial-services","sectorDisp":"Financial Services","longBusinessSummary":"Münchener Rückversicherungs-Gesellschaft Aktiengesellschaft in München engages in the insurance and reinsurance businesses worldwide. The company operates through six segments: Life and Health Reinsurance, Property-Casualty Reinsurance, Global Specialty Insurance, ERGO Life and Health Germany, ERGO Property-Casualty Germany, and ERGO International. The company offers life and health reinsurance solutions, such as digital underwriting and advanced analytics solutions, health insurance management system, financial market risks, financing, portfolio risk management, digitalized investment-linked solution, data analytics, underwriting and claims, medical research, capital management, and health market, as well as MIRA digital suite that includes MIRA PoS, MIRApply insured and physician, claims risk assessment, and CLARA plus. It also provides property and casualty reinsurance solutions, including agricultural reinsurance; business advisory, personal lines, portfolio management, insurance consulting, commercial motor consulting; infrastructure risk; property insurance, location risk, insurance linked securities, and NatCatSERVICE for natural catastrophe loss database; prospective structured and retroactive reinsurance; risk transfer; cyber; and data analytics, REALYTIX ZERO, and cert2go. In addition, the company offers solutions for industry clients, such as corporate risk, new tech, green tech, parametric, and aviation and space solutions, as well as risk services. Further, it provides specialty property casualty insurance, such as professional liability, marine, cyber, aviation, and space for commercial and private customers. Additionally, the company offers life, property-casualty, health, legal protection, and travel insurance products under the ERGO brand; and insurance solutions for agriculture, captive, epidemic, cyber, and renewable energy sectors. The company was founded in 1880 and is based in Munich, Germany.","fullTimeEmployees":44595,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Christoph  Jurecka","age":51,"title":"CEO & Chairman of Management Board","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":3415650,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Thomas  Blunck","age":60,"title":"Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1965,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":3070625,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Markus  Riess","age":59,"title":"Head of Economics, Sustainability & Public Affairs and Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":1001563,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Mari-Lizette  Malherbe","title":"Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":2146000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Nicholas J. Gartside C.F.A.","age":50,"title":"Chief Investment Officer & Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1975,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":2146000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Achim  Kassow","age":59,"title":"Chief Transformation Officer & Member of Management Board","yearBorn":1966,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":2146000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stefan Heinrich Golling","age":48,"title":"Member of Management Board & Labour Relations Director","yearBorn":1977,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":2146000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Clarisse  Kopff","title":"Member of Management Board","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":214